Cell["\<\
The insertion happens inside the composite (composition, product, sum or \
network) containing the position; the surrounding diagram is rebuilt with its \
original options.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"10c4d8ff-164c-4480-9c28-f5a61704a2a9"]
}, Open  ]],

